Package: predator-led
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, systemd
Maintainer: slavs <kamo.dev@gmail.com>
Description: LED control for Acer Predator Orion PO5-640 desktops
 Controls the case/fan/motherboard RGB lighting of the Predator Orion PO5-640
 through the BIOS AcerGamingFunction WMI interface (what PredatorSense does on
 Windows). Contains the predator_wmi kernel module (built with DKMS, rebuilt
 automatically on kernel upgrades), the predator-led command line tool and a
 system tray application.
